BBUUGGSS
       rrccssffrreeeezzee does not check whether any sources are checked out and  modi‐
       fied.

       Although  both  source file names and RCS file names are accepted, they
       are not paired as usual with RCS commands.

       Error checking is rudimentary.

       rrccssffrreeeezzee is just an optional example shell script, and should  not  be
       taken too seriously.  See CVS for a more complete solution.

